# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Captured pages, raw extracts, inference cache and ledgers. ~260 MB, and the
# raw store is deliberately private: prompts and cached responses carry page
# content fetched from municipal portals, which stays on the machine that
# fetched it. `docs/evidence/` publishes the derived numbers.
data/*
data/spike_a/*

# ...with one exception. `classification.csv` is 28 rows of derived public
# data - office names, FIPS codes, portal buckets, demonstrated verdicts - with
# no page content in it. Fourteen tests recompute published figures directly
# from this file, so committing it is what lets a fresh clone verify the
# coverage arithmetic instead of taking it on trust.
!data/spike_a/
!data/spike_a/classification.csv

# Interview prep, resume bullets, self-red-team, pitch. Working notes about
# the author, not about the project.
INTERNAL/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment and caches
